dex":"021","VerseNumber":70,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَرَادُواْ بِهِۦ كَيۡدٗا فَجَعَلۡنَٰهُمُ ٱلۡأَخۡسَرِينَ","TajweedText":"وَأَرَادُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> كَيْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>دًا ف</tajweed>َجَعَلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخْسَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٠</span>","End":"٧٠","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":71,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَجَّيۡنَٰهُ وَلُوطًا إِلَى ٱلۡأَرۡضِ ٱلَّتِي بَٰرَكۡنَا فِيهَا لِلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","TajweedText":"وَنَجَّيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ وَلُوطًا إِلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّتِى بَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رَكْنَا فِيهَا لِلْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧١</span>","End":"٧١","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":21,"SurahIndex":"021","VerseNumber":72,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَوَهَبۡنَا لَهُۥٓ إِسۡحَٰقَ وَيَعۡقُوبَ نَافِلَةٗۖ وَكُلّٗا جَعَلۡنَا صَٰلِحِينَ","TajweedText":"وَوَهَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>نَا لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> إِسْحَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قَ وَيَعْقُوبَ نَافِلَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً‌ۖ و</tajweed>َكُل<tajweed class=ikhafa>اًّ ج</tajweed>َعَلْنَا صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٢</span>","End":"٧٢","PageNumber":327,"JuzNumber":17,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":282,"MaqraNumber":131,"HizbNumber":33,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"